Setup a toy AI air temperature modeil.

1. setup a conda env (based on anemoi, or NOAA/EPIC EAGLE):
   EAGLEhome=/scratch5/purged/Wei.Huang/src/EAGLE
   source ${EAGLEhome}/conda/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
   eval "$(mamba shell hook --shell bash)"
   mamba activate anemoi

2. run utils/gen-global.py 
   to generate h3 grid.
   python gen-global.py --resolution 2 --output_dir ./ --filename global_h3_res2.geojson

3. convert geojson to netcdf file:
   python geojson2netcdf.py -i global_h3_res2.geojson -o global_h3_res2_with_bounds.nc [-v air_h3]

4. append static geography data:
   python append_to_master_grid.py \
      -g global_h3_res2_with_bounds.nc \
      -e ../data/ETOPO_2022_v1_60s_N90W180_geoid.nc
